*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% NearPrint(TM) - virtual printer that dispatches jobs to the nearest print shop.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "NEARPRNT.PPD"
*Product: "(NearPrint)"
*Manufacturer: "NearPrint"
*ModelName: "NearPrint Print Shop Dispatcher"
*ShortNickName: "NearPrint"
*NickName: "NearPrint - nearest print shop"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*APPrinterIconPath: "/Library/Printers/Icons/NearPrint.icns"

*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tabloid/Tabloid 11x17: "<</PageSize[792 1224]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tabloid/Tabloid 11x17: "<</PageSize[792 1224]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[842 1191]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*ImageableArea Tabloid/Tabloid 11x17: "0 0 792 1224"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "0 0 842 1191"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Tabloid/Tabloid 11x17: "792 1224"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "842 1191"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Black and White: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Single-sided: ""
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Two-sided, long edge: ""
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Two-sided, short edge: ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*OpenGroup: NearPrint/NearPrint Dispatch
*OpenUI *Priority/Optimize for: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Priority
*DefaultPriority: Nearest
*Priority Nearest/Closest shop: ""
*Priority Price/Lowest price: ""
*Priority Turnaround/Fastest turnaround: ""
*Priority OpenNow/Open right now: ""
*Priority Quality/Best reviews and quality: ""
*CloseUI: *Priority

*OpenUI *MaxDistance/Search radius: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *MaxDistance
*DefaultMaxDistance: 5mi
*MaxDistance 1mi/Walking, 1 mile: ""
*MaxDistance 2mi/2 miles: ""
*MaxDistance 5mi/5 miles: ""
*MaxDistance 10mi/10 miles: ""
*MaxDistance 25mi/25 miles: ""
*CloseUI: *MaxDistance

*OpenUI *ShopType/Shop type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ShopType
*DefaultShopType: Any
*ShopType Any/Anything that prints: ""
*ShopType Chains/Chains only, Staples, FedEx Office, UPS Store, Office Depot: ""
*ShopType Local/Local print shops only: ""
*ShopType Travel/Travel, hotel business centers, libraries, kiosks: ""
*CloseUI: *ShopType

*OpenUI *Pickup/Needed by: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Pickup
*DefaultPickup: ASAP
*Pickup ASAP/As soon as possible: ""
*Pickup Today/Later today: ""
*Pickup Tomorrow/Tomorrow: ""
*Pickup ThisWeek/This week: ""
*CloseUI: *Pickup

*OpenUI *Binding/Finishing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Binding
*DefaultBinding: None
*Binding None/Loose, no finishing: ""
*Binding Staple/Stapled: ""
*Binding ThreeHole/3-hole punched: ""
*Binding Spiral/Spiral or coil bound: ""
*Binding Comb/Comb bound: ""
*CloseUI: *Binding

*OpenUI *PaperStock/Paper stock: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PaperStock
*DefaultPaperStock: Standard
*PaperStock Standard/Standard 20 lb copy paper: ""
*PaperStock Heavy/Heavy 32 lb: ""
*PaperStock Cardstock/Cardstock: ""
*PaperStock Glossy/Glossy: ""
*CloseUI: *PaperStock

*OpenUI *Delivery/How to send the job: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Delivery
*DefaultDelivery: Confirm
*Delivery Confirm/Show me the pick, then send: ""
*Delivery Auto/Send to the best shop without asking: ""
*Delivery FindOnly/Just find a shop, I will bring the file: ""
*CloseUI: *Delivery

*OpenUI *ConfirmLocation/Confirm my location first: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ConfirmLocation
*DefaultConfirmLocation: Auto
*ConfirmLocation Auto/Only when unsure: ""
*ConfirmLocation Yes/Always ask me: ""
*ConfirmLocation No/Never, use what it finds: ""
*CloseUI: *ConfirmLocation
*CloseGroup: NearPrint

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*% End of NearPrint.ppd
